1
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,879
杰
Jay?

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,120
你看到葡萄了没
Have you seen the grapes?

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,500
-我吃完了 -你为什么把葡萄吃了
- Yeah, I ate them. - Why would you eat the grapes?

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,000
因为它们放在碗里 洗过了
They were in a bowl, they were washed,

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,000
而且是我花钱买的
I paid for them.

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,620
那是为新年准备的
They were for the new year's.

7
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,880
对了 要用它们做什么蠢事来着
Oh, right. What's that goofy thing again?

8
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,560
才不蠢呢 那是一种传统
It's not goofy. It's a tradition.

9
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,540
你在午夜时分吃下12颗葡萄
At midnight, you eat 12 grapes,

10
00:00:18,742 --> 00:00:21,751
许下12个心愿 新年的每个月一个
you make 12 wishes, 1 for each month of the year.

11
00:00:21,751 --> 00:00:23,270
你还真相信吗
And you really think that works?

12
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,260
五年前
Five years ago,

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:26,740
我是一名住在贫民窟里的单亲妈妈
I was a single mother living in a slum.

14
00:00:27,188 --> 00:00:29,637
如今 我就要开着新车
Today, I'm driving to Palm Springs

15
00:00:29,637 --> 00:00:32,276
和我的大款老公一起去棕榈泉了
in my new car with my rich husband.

16
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,440
随你怎么样 反正我要吃葡萄
You do what you want. I'm eating the grapes.

17
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,020
除夕之夜 我们会带着菲尔和克莱尔
For new year's eve, we're taking Phil and Claire

18
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,060
以及米奇尔和小卡去棕榈泉一家
and Mitch and Cam to this amazing hotel

19
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,400
我曾住过的一家超棒的酒店玩
I used to go to in Palm Springs.

20
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,980
他们那儿提供全套的服务
They got a whole package--

21
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,180
晚餐 舞蹈和午夜祝酒
Dinner, dancing, toast at midnight.

22
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,520
我想问 夫复何求啊
I mean, what more do you need?

23
00:00:46,699 --> 00:00:48,808
-葡萄 -我说过我们会在路上停一下的
- Grapes. - I said we'd stop on the way.

24
00:00:51,126 --> 00:00:52,316
海莉 今天是除夕夜
Haley, it's new year's eve.

25
00:00:52,316 --> 00:00:54,245
你确定你不想参加个派对什么的
Are you sure you don't wanna go to a party or something?

26
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,760
然后听我所有的朋友唠叨
And listen to all my friends talk about

27
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,100
大学生活有多赞吗
how awesome college is?

28
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,480
我知道大学生活有多赞
I know how awesome college is.

29
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,420
那正是我被踢出来的原因
That's what got me kicked out.

30
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:00,980
我相信米奇尔舅舅
Well, I'm sure uncle Mitchell

31
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:02,440
要是知道有你在家坐镇的话
will feel much better leaving Lily here

32
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,360
一定会更乐意把莉莉留在我们家的
knowing that you're in charge.

33
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:07,160
你知道其实是你管事 对吧
You know you're really in charge, right?

34
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,920
你们怎么就知道我不用参加派对呢
How do you know I don't have a party?

35
00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:12,060
好吧 当我没问
Okay, fine.

36
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,980
莉莉 你准备好和表哥表姐们一起住了吗
Lily, are you ready for your big sleepover with your cousins?

37
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,260
谁照看我啊
Who's watching me?

38
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:21,640
-海莉 -我说真的
- Haley. - I'm serious.

39
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:22,260
艾丽克斯
Alex.

40
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,180
好的 我们走吧
Okay, let's go.

41
00:01:25,110 --> 00:01:26,559
每年的除夕夜 都是
Every new year's eve, it's like,

42
00:01:26,559 --> 00:01:28,748
"我们干点啥 我们干点啥"
"What are we gonna do? What are we gonna do?"

43
00:01:28,928 --> 00:01:31,197
所以我们对杰策划的活动很满意
So we were happy that Jay planned this whole thing.

44
00:01:31,197 --> 00:01:32,886
那真的是 免去了我们为了
It really, you know, takes the pressure off

45
00:01:32,886 --> 00:01:34,025
超越自己而承受的压力
of having to outdo ourselves.

46
00:01:34,025 --> 00:01:36,714
是啊 叫我们如何胜过去年呢
Yeah, and how are we gonna possibly top last year?

47
00:01:38,613 --> 00:01:39,592
我们睡过头了吗
Oh. Did we miss it?

48
00:01:39,592 --> 00:01:41,991
才十点钟
It's only 10:00.

49
00:01:41,991 --> 00:01:43,360
-什么 -才十点钟
- What? - It's only 10:00.

50
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:45,629
-什么 -才十点钟
- What? - It's only 10:00.

51
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,040
这地方比我印象里小了点
Place is smaller than I remember.

52
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,340
你就觉得小而已吗
Smaller's your issue?

53
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,100
杰 你上次来这里是什么时候
When was the last time that you were here, Jay?

54
00:02:06,179 --> 00:02:08,788
没多久 74年75年左右
Not that long ago. 1974, '75.

55
00:02:08,788 --> 00:02:09,997
是我两岁的时候吗
So when I was 2?

56
00:02:09,997 --> 00:02:11,307
你这么说我就不乐意了
I don't like when you do that.

57
00:02:11,307 --> 00:02:13,705
我看过他们的网站 照片看起来挺漂亮的
I checked the web site. The pictures looked beautiful.

58
00:02:13,705 --> 00:02:15,285
妈呀 蜥蜴
Oh! Lizard. Huh?

59
00:02:15,285 --> 00:02:17,464
永远别相信网上的照片
Never trust pictures on the internet.

60
00:02:17,474 --> 00:02:18,353
只要找好拍照的角度
Shoot it from the right angle,

61
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:20,340
你可以让所有东西显得更大更好
You can make anything look bigger and better.

62
00:02:21,801 --> 00:02:23,860
他说的是房子 死变态 他是房产经纪人
Houses, you pervs. He's a realtor.

63
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:26,349
我就觉得听到动静了
I thought I heard voices.

64
00:02:26,349 --> 00:02:29,767
罗比 我跟你说嘛 来人了
Robby! I told you! It's people.

65
00:02:29,797 --> 00:02:31,746
我的天呐 那就是20年后的我啊
Oh, my god. That's me in 20 years!

66
00:02:31,746 --> 00:02:33,615
好吧 你要是她 我就是抛弃她的人
Okay, you be her, and I'll be whoever left her.

67
00:02:33,625 --> 00:02:35,225
我们办入住 预订名字是普里契特
Uh, we're checking in. It's under Pritchett.

68
00:02:35,225 --> 00:02:37,653
杰·普里契特 三间房
Jay pritchett. Three rooms.

69
00:02:39,540 --> 00:02:41,320
你以前在我们这里住过
You've been with us before.

70
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:42,660
那个本子用了多少年了
How old is that book?

71
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:44,520
这里有些什么东西黏黏糊糊的
Oh, there is something sticky over here.

72
00:02:44,730 --> 00:02:45,889
罗比
Robby!

73
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,500
那东西回来了
It came back.

74
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:49,280
不可能啊
It's not possible.

75
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:53,420
好吧 这个地方确实大不如前了
Okay, so the place is not what it used to be.

76
00:02:53,895 --> 00:02:55,465
不过我们还是会玩得开心的
But we're gonna have fun.

77
00:02:55,495 --> 00:02:57,094
在星光照耀的房间里用餐
Dining in the starlight room,

78
00:02:57,094 --> 00:02:59,183
在谢莉·斯特罗曼三重奏下翩翩起舞
little dancing with the Shelley Stroman trio.

79
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:02,020
三人组只剩两人了 给你钥匙
Oh, there's just two left. Here are your keys.

80
00:03:02,501 --> 00:03:04,850
退房时间是11点 要是你想待久一点
Check out's at 11:00, but if you wanna stay longer--

81
00:03:04,850 --> 00:03:07,819
11点没问题
11:00 is good.

82
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:10,520
就是这里了
Here we go.

83
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:14,300
有什么问题吗
Is there anything wrong?

84
00:03:14,515 --> 00:03:16,054
没有没有 我们只是希望
No, no. No, we were just hoping for something

85
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:17,760
-更有浪漫气氛 -拜托
- a little more romantic. - Come on, now.

86
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,720
没有那么糟糕
It's not that bad.

87
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,540
-那里面有什么 -没什么
- What's in there? - Nothing.

88
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:22,940
要是你想找浪漫的地方
If you're looking for romance,

89
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,920
附近有一处很隐蔽的温泉
there's a secluded hot spring nearby.

90
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:28,680
-就像一块璞玉 -是吗
- Kind of a hidden gem. - Huh?

91
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,860
只要顺着高尔夫球场
Just follow the path

92
00:03:29,898 --> 00:03:32,146
12号洞右边的小路走就能找到
right by the 12th hole of the golf course.

93
00:03:33,826 --> 00:03:35,105
听起来很不错啊
That sounds kinda nice.

94
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:37,280
隐蔽的 天然的
Secluded. Natural.

95
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,140
-性感的 -性感的
- Sexy. - Sexy.

96
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:41,140
你觉得怎么样 菲尔
What do you think, phil?

97
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:42,660
温泉有没有鸡蛋味儿啊
Does it smell like eggs?

98
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:43,780
有些温泉跟鸡蛋一个味儿
Some of them smell like eggs.

99
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,920
我和菲尔已经好久没有...
It's been a while since Phil and I...

100
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,740
十二月份整个月
The whole month of December?

101
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,080
都没有一次...
Not even a...

102
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,820
或者是打快...你懂的
Or a quick... you know?

103
00:03:55,635 --> 00:03:57,114
说起来挺难为情 那不是我们的作风
It's embarrassing, and it's not like us.

104
00:03:57,114 --> 00:03:58,084
让我觉得很紧张
That's making me anxious,

105
00:03:58,084 --> 00:04:00,522
所以我才会真的需要...
Which is why I really need to get...

106
00:04:00,742 --> 00:04:01,952
再次感谢
Thanks again.

107
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,500
对 那是给你的
Yeah, that's yours to keep.

108
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:04,700
好了
Okay.

109
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,060
再见了
Bye now.

110
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:10,380
我建议我们不和我爸吃晚餐了
I say we bag dinner with my dad,

111
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:11,480
去找那个温泉吧
and go find that hot spring.

112
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,300
亲爱的 我们不能丢下你爸
Honey, we can't just ditch your father.

113
00:04:13,300 --> 00:04:14,460
他希望我们全家人一起
He wanted us all to be together.

114
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,780
我们一直在一起
We are always together.

115
00:04:15,925 --> 00:04:17,164
我的天 难道我们还指望
Oh, my god, what are we gonna hear

116
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:18,720
听到什么新鲜事吗
that we've never heard before?

117
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,040
米奇尔和小卡那个关于莉莉如何用
Mitch and Cam's inspiring story

118
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,820
海姆立克急救法救下小孩的动人故事吗
of how lily saved that kid with the Heimlich?

119
00:04:22,820 --> 00:04:24,440
拜托 不就是她抱他一下
Please. She hugged him,

120
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:25,460
他就把口香糖吐出来了嘛
and he spit his gum out.

121
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:29,020
不如我们拿上一瓶香槟
I say we get a bottle of champagne,

122
00:04:29,380 --> 00:04:30,480
仰望着星空
Look up at the stars,

123
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,140
不穿游泳衣
forget our bathing suits.

124
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,600
听起来确实诱人
That does sound hot.

125
00:04:34,865 --> 00:04:37,374
不过到时我只会一心想着你爸的
But I'd just be thinking about your dad the whole time.

126
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,580
我去冲个澡
I'm gonna hop in the shower.

127
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:43,520
里面有什么
What's in there?

128
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:43,980
没什么
Nothing.

129
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,020
太好了 不 是好极了
Oh, perfect. No, great.

130
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:48,840
要是我们需要袜子的话
If we need any socks,

131
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:49,560
床上正好有人留了一只
someone left one in the bed.

132
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,820
我的神呐 克里斯宾去灯塔
Oh, my gosh. There is no way Crispin stays here

133
00:04:51,820 --> 00:04:52,820
是绝不会住在这里的
when he comes to the Beacon.

134
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,020
什么灯塔
What's the beacon?

135
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,000
就是他经常大加赞赏的那个俱乐部啊
The club that he's always raving about.

136
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:57,000
就在那条街边上
It's right down the street.

137
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,680
那才是我们该去的地方
That's where we should go.

138
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,340
迎新年找乐子的地方
Somewhere fun for new year's,

139
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:02,000
趁着我们还算年...轻吧
while we're still young... ish.

140
00:05:02,242 --> 00:05:04,011
我们翘掉晚饭去那里吧
L-let's get out of dinner and go there.

141
00:05:04,011 --> 00:05:05,270
-怎么翘 -我不知道
- How? - I don't know.

142
00:05:05,270 --> 00:05:06,979
有了 有了
Um... okay, okay.

143
00:05:06,979 --> 00:05:09,608
你可以在餐桌上假装病了
Um, y-you could pretend to get sick at the table.

144
00:05:09,618 --> 00:05:11,297
假装咳嗽 胃疼
You know, fake a cough, stomachache,

145
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,360
随你选 我无所谓
dealer's choice. I don't care.

146
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,080
装得像一点 好让我们离开
Just sell it and get us out of there.

147
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,020
可是你爸怎么办
But what about your dad?

148
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:16,400
他想让全家人聚在一起
He wants the family to be together.

149
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,160
我们总在一起
We are always together.

150
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:20,280
我们都听克莱尔讲了无数次
I mean, how many times do we have to hear Claire tell us

151
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:22,000
卢克对儿科医生的搞笑反驳了
Luke's hilarious comeback to the pediatrician?

152
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:24,200
天啊 我们真应该叫她"矮平房"
Oh, gosh. We should start calling her "Ranch house"...

153
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:26,340
因为她没有第二层[第二个故事]
Because she doesn't have a second story.

154
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:29,300
-不错嘛 -我知道 谢谢
- So good. - I know! Thank you.

155
00:05:31,597 --> 00:05:32,976
你确定不跟我们一起玩
Hey. You sure you don't wanna play

156
00:05:32,976 --> 00:05:33,596
"饥饿游戏"吗
"The hunger games" with all of us?

157
00:05:33,660 --> 00:05:34,940
我的人生就是一出饥饿游戏
My whole life is a hunger game.

158
00:05:35,020 --> 00:05:36,340
不然你以为我为什么对你这么刻薄
Why do you think I'm so mean to you?

159
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,260
找我的
That's for me!

160
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,300
进来吧
Hey. Come on in.

161
00:05:42,672 --> 00:05:43,371
-嗨 -嗨
- Hey. - Hi.

162
00:05:43,371 --> 00:05:44,441
嘿 我出局了
Hey, I'm out.

163
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:46,320
这是贝卡和她的表姐乔伊丝
This is Becca and her cousin Joyce.

164
00:05:46,859 --> 00:05:48,179
乔伊丝是你的
And Joyce is for you.

165
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,440
什么 我有约会吗
What? I'm on a date?

166
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,960
可我还没喷古龙水
But I'm not wearing any cologne.

167
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:52,720
你之前知道这事吗
Did you know this was happening?

168
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,360
我现在也不知道这怎么回事
I don't even know what this is.

169
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,620
乔伊丝 这是曼尼
Joyce, this is Manny.

170
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:57,320
初次见面 甚感荣幸
Pleasure to make your acquaintance.

171
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,480
不知小姐是否有意来杯气泡果酒呢
Can I offer you a glass of sparkling cider?

172
00:05:59,980 --> 00:06:01,680
他可不是你说的那样
He's not how you described him.

173
00:06:01,802 --> 00:06:03,351
别担心 你会爱他的
Uh, don't worry. You'll love him.

174
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:04,500
曼尼 说点浪漫的
Manny, say something romantic.

175
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:07,320
我没法突然打开浪漫模式 你来说些浪漫的
I can't just turn it on. You say something romantic.

176
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,120
衣服不错
Cool shirt.

177
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,320
我能参观你房间吗
Can I see your room?

178
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,840
专门为你打扫了
Well, I didn't clean it for me.

